                                                "sense_id": "524517b1-a504-3c8c-b2bd-13aa27de13c8",
                                                "text": "his sense of adventure"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a42d338-2532-382f-b8e5-287d0c704062",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A remarkable occurrence; a striking event."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac7bd7ae-2560-4264-bf91-1ebcfead9b24",
                                                "sense_id": "5a42d338-2532-382f-b8e5-287d0c704062",
                                                "text": "A life full of adventures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5f64042-413c-3d43-9ab0-be7224009a32",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A daring feat; a bold undertaking, in which dangers are likely to be encountered, and the issue is staked upon unforeseen events; the encountering of risks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8736a380-72e4-443b-bb88-b600618ebeff",
                                                "sense_id": "c5f64042-413c-3d43-9ab0-be7224009a32",
                                                "text": "He loved excitement and adventure."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36ce1219-a06e-3724-b844-618b76ba5ae4",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mercantile or speculative enterprise of hazard; a venture; a shipment by a merchant on his own account."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4104f90-2623-3d3b-96b8-1ee75f77d202",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A text adventure or an adventure game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b20f8e64-3d67-4f98-b2f0-1d8e23d25fed",
                                                "sense_id": "a4104f90-2623-3d3b-96b8-1ee75f77d202",
                                                "text": "The first thing to strike me about Spyplane was that it is more like a verbal simulation than an adventure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c38e3772-0ecf-499d-a037-7e09a6e202be",
                                                "sense_id": "a4104f90-2623-3d3b-96b8-1ee75f77d202",
                                                "text": "To sum up, I think this is definitely one of the best adventures around for the Spectrum now, along with Gnome Ranger[...]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3bc6101-a628-4bbf-ac8d-044c060ea757",
                                                "sense_id": "a4104f90-2623-3d3b-96b8-1ee75f77d202",
                                                "text": "Before you sit down in front of your Speccy to play an adventure, equip yourself with a pencil, eraser and plenty of paper. This so that you may draw a 'map' of the adventure as you move around."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6995045-136e-38ed-9f64-7c635a26b3d9",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That which happens by chance; hazard; hap."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d42e6b49-81e0-342d-8ed9-2497424ce68d",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chance of danger or loss."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4b16ff02-846b-3b7c-8d4d-0d6e6f0ccd66",
                                        "entry_id": "0083fd3e-c4e0-3602-9105-ba8dfffd34c2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Risk; danger; peril."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc273303-e257-4003-8c76-cad351cdd6be",
                                                "sense_id": "4b16ff02-846b-3b7c-8d4d-0d6e6f0ccd66",
                                                "text": "He was in great adventure of his life."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "adventure",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c3425e5-b6ad-3572-8c2b-f785e13aafa1",
                                        "entry_id": "257c2bf7-db90-335f-a665-eb2d826dcc52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To risk or hazard; jeopard; venture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7384485a-5b3a-4ae0-9ffa-2bbf73cc2d70",
                                                "sense_id": "4c3425e5-b6ad-3572-8c2b-f785e13aafa1",
                                                "text": "So it is reaſon, that wher the citizen aduentureth his lyfe, there the citie ſhould doe him ſome honor after his death."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cd3af249-1d41-462f-b68a-e224abde6491",
                                                "sense_id": "4c3425e5-b6ad-3572-8c2b-f785e13aafa1",
                                                "text": "And certain of the chief of Asia, which were his friends, sent unto him, desiring him that he would not adventure himself into the theatre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cc84cfc-cbdd-48d4-bf3b-ddd5cf7fa64f",
                                                "sense_id": "4c3425e5-b6ad-3572-8c2b-f785e13aafa1",
                                                "text": "In 1903, I had adventured, for the first time, northwards, and it really was the North, as my objective was the Great North of Scotland Railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3df0a230-3d6e-3007-88d6-215ad35d35c5",
                                        "entry_id": "257c2bf7-db90-335f-a665-eb2d826dcc52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To venture upon; to run the risk of; to dare."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f7df8d5-fcd8-4026-8cb5-7cff9b481094",
                                                "sense_id": "3df0a230-3d6e-3007-88d6-215ad35d35c5",
                                                "text": "Yet they adventured to go back; but it was ſo dark, and the flood was ſo high, that in their going back, they had like to have been drowned nine or ten times.."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcfdea8d-39fb-44ae-81fa-a3886287e887",
                                                "sense_id": "3df0a230-3d6e-3007-88d6-215ad35d35c5",
                                                "text": "Discriminations might be adventured."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c391e540-b04a-395b-b044-801141c2ce56",
                                        "entry_id": "257c2bf7-db90-335f-a665-eb2d826dcc52",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To try the chance; to take the risk."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e103173-0e54-44cb-a48b-45ca589e2d19",
                                                "sense_id": "c391e540-b04a-395b-b044-801141c2ce56",
                                                "text": "The year following the ſaid [William] Warham was tranſlated to Canterbury, at whoſe inthronization ſomething occurred relating to this Univerſity; which though a little out of the road, yet I ſhall adventure to remember it, and it is this."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
